{"ops":[{"insert":"实例选择器允许用户从不同的数据库实例类型中选择实例，并提供了手动输入功能。组件支持多种数据库类型，如MongoDB、MySQL、Redis等，并且可以根据不同的数据库类型展示不同的配置选项。\n\n交互展示"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"width":"1094"},"insert":{"image":"data:image/png;base64,"}},{"insert":"\n\n主要功能"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"1. **实例选择**：用户可以从提供的数据库实例列表中选择实例。\n2. **手动输入**：如果用户无法从列表中找到所需的实例，可以通过手动输入功能添加实例。\n3. **多类型支持**：组件支持多种数据库类型的实例选择。\n4. **配置选项**：根据不同的数据库类型，组件提供了不同的配置选项，如角色、状态、管控区域等。\n5. **预览结果**：用户在选择实例后，可以预览所选实例的结果。\n6. **提交和取消操作**：用户可以选择确认提交所选实例，或者取消操作。\n\n使用方法"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"1. **引入组件**：在父组件中引入并注册该实例选择器组件。\n2. **配置属性**：根据需要配置组件的属性，如`clusterTypes`（支持的数据库类型）、`tabListConfig`（自定义选项卡配置）、`selected`（预选的实例）等。\n3. **监听事件**：监听组件的`change`和`cancel`事件，以便在用户提交或取消操作时执行相应的逻辑。\n4. **使用插槽**：如果需要自定义底部提交按钮的提示信息，可以使用`submitTips`插槽。\n\nVue组件关键属性"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"Props"},{"attributes":{"header":2},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- `clusterTypes`：支持的数据库类型数组。\n- `tabListConfig`：自定义选项卡配置。\n- `selected`：预选的实例。\n- `unqiuePanelValue`：是否只允许选择一种类型的实例。\n- `unqiuePanelTips`：当`unqiuePanelValue`为`true`时显示的提示信息。\n- `hideManualInput`：是否隐藏手动输入选项。\n- `onlyOneType`：是否只允许选择一种类型的实例。\n- `disableDialogSubmitMethod`：一个函数，用于在提交前对所选实例进行校验。\n\nEmits"},{"attributes":{"header":2},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"- `change`：当用户提交所选实例时触发，传递当前的实例选择。\n- `cancel`：当用户取消操作时触发。\n\n示例代码"},{"attributes":{"header":1},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  <InstanceSelector"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    :clusterTypes=\"['TENDBCLUSTER', 'TENDBSINGLE', 'TENDBHA']\""},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    :selected=\"selectedInstances\""},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    @change=\"handleInstanceChange\""},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    @cancel=\"handleCancel\">"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    <template #submitTips=\"{ hostList }\">"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"      <span>已选择 {{ hostList.length }} 个实例</span>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"    </template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  </InstanceSelector>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</template>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"plain"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"<script setup>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"import { ref } from 'vue';"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"import InstanceSelector from './path-to-instance-selector.vue';"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const selectedInstances = ref({});"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const handleInstanceChange = (values) => {"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  selectedInstances.value = values;"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  // 处理实例选择后的逻辑"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"};"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"const handleCancel = () => {"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"  // 处理取消操作的逻辑"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"};"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"</script>"},{"attributes":{"code-block":"vue"},"insert":"\n\n"},{"insert":"\n在上述示例中，我们创建了一个`InstanceSelector`组件实例，并配置了支持的数据库类型为`TENDBCLUSTER`、`TENDBSINGLE`和`TENDBHA`。我们还监听了`change`和`cancel`事件，并定义了相应的处理函数。此外，我们还使用了`submitTips`插槽来自定义提交按钮的提示信息。\n"}]}